 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 646508,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\">\n    <li>A seed is planted in a glass pot, and its height is measured in centimeters every day.</li>\n  </ol>\n<img alt=\"A scatter plot. Horizontal, 0 to 30, by 1’s, labeled days. Vertical, negative 5 to 3, by point 5’s, labeled height in centimeters. 21 dots trend linearly up and to the right with a line a best fit.\" src=\"exercises/media/d0d130f8f6a3dbef.svg\">\n<p>The best fit line is given by the equation <span data-math=\"y=0.404x-5.18\">y=0.404x-5.18</span>, where <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>\n represents the height of the plant above ground level, and <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> represents the number of days since it was planted.</p>\n<p>What is the slope of the best fit line? What does the slope of the line mean in this situation?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1272809,
     "content_html": "The slope is <span data-math=\"0.404\">0.404</span>, which means the plant grows 1 centimeter every <span data-math=\"0.404\">0.404</span> days."
    },
    {
     "id": 1272810,
     "content_html": "The slope is <span data-math=\"-5.18\">-5.18</span>, which means for every day, the plant shrinks <span data-math=\"-5.18\">-5.18</span> centimeters."
    },
    {
     "id": 1272811,
     "content_html": "The slope is <span data-math=\"0.404\">0.404</span>, which means for every day, the plant grows <span data-math=\"0.404\">0.404</span> centimeters."
    },
    {
     "id": 1272812,
     "content_html": "The slope is <span data-math=\"5.18\">5.18</span>, which means for every day, the plant grows <span data-math=\"5.18\">5.18</span> centimeters."
    }
   ],
